= How New Zealand's healthcare system is failing people with osteoarthritis
#smallcaps[Published]\ 31 March 2021

#smallcaps[Citation]\ #eval("Abbott JH, Wilson R. How New Zealand's healthcare system is failing people with osteoarthritis. The Conversation,, 31 March 2021. Available at: https://theconversation.com/how-new-zealands-healthcare-system-is-failing-people-with-osteoarthritis-157138", mode: "markup")

=== Abstract
An article for a general audience on problems with the management of osteoarthritis
in the New Zealand healthcare system, and recommendations for delivering more
effective and cost-effective treatments, based on our HRC-funded research.

